OL,3,GSouth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FDry and settled to start the
OL,6,Fnew week with light winds. Morning
OL,7,Fcloud breaking and clearing to leave
OL,8,Fan increasingly sunny day across the
OL,9,Fregion. Feeling warm in the sunshine.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTonight:FPlenty of late brightness to
OL,12,Fend Monday. Remaining dry with largely
OL,13,Fclear skies overnight aside from
OL,14,Fpatchy low cloud around the Moors. A
OL,15,Frather warm night in urban areas.
OL,16,
OL,17,CTuesday:FAnother fine and dry day with
OL,18,Fplenty of strong sunshine across the
OL,19,Fregion. Slightly breezier than Monday
OL,20,Fbut temperatures climbing higher.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
