OL,3,GSouth West
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Wednesday to Friday:FHeat
OL,6,Fpeaking on Wednesday and Thursday with
OL,7,Ffurther strong sunshine. Areas of
OL,8,Fcloud arriving to end the week but
OL,9,Fstill remaining largely dry with no
OL,10,Fsubstantial rain.
